{%- comment -%}
  UDC — Página de producto (buy box con selector de cantidad + order bump)

  Sin diseño de referencia recuperado (el artifact original era una landing
  de una sola página, sin página de producto), pero SÍ hay una referencia
  real: un video de otra tienda (tinomrkt.myshopify.com) que ya tiene esta
  misma landing construida, mostrando el diseño exacto a seguir:

  · (El video mostraba el header nativo de Horizon visible, pero después el
    usuario pidió la página de producto sin header ni footer: se ocultan
    con udc-hide-chrome, full: true.)
  · Título + precio con -% OFF, 4 beneficios con ícono, separador
    "LLEVÁ MÁS & AHORRÁ", countdown de oferta, selector "Llevando 1/2/3"
    con descuento por cantidad, order-bump, botón, "Pago Seguro En Línea",
    medios de pago (píldoras), 3 badges de confianza y, debajo, tabs
    Descripción / Entrega / Garantía (la descripción del producto vive ahí,
    no arriba del precio).

  Todo con datos 100% reales:
  · El descuento por cantidad NO es un descuento automático de Shopify: es
    el producto real con un option "Cantidad" de 3 variantes (1/2/3), cada
    una con su propio price/compareAtPrice ya cargado en Shopify. El precio
    que se ve acá es EXACTAMENTE el que se cobra en el checkout.
  · El "+10%/+15% OFF EXTRA" de las tarjetas 2 y 3 se calcula en vivo
    comparando el precio unitario de cada variante contra el de la
    variante 1 — no está hardcodeado.
  · El order bump apunta a un producto real (settings.bump_product)
    elegido desde el editor del tema — su precio sale en vivo de Shopify.
  · "Entrega" y "Garantía" son texto editable (settings): no hay ninguna
    política de envío/garantía real recuperada todavía, así que quedan con
    un texto por defecto razonable para un producto digital, listo para
    que el comerciante lo ajuste.
{%- endcomment -%}

{% render 'udc-base' %}
{% render 'udc-hide-chrome', full: true %}

{%- assign current_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}
{%- assign tier1 = product.variants.first -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Barra mínima con el logo: el header nativo está oculto (udc-hide-chrome,
  full: true), pero el usuario quiere conservar el logo arriba. Usa el
  logo de la configuración del tema (settings.logo) y, si no hay, el nombre
  de la tienda como texto — igual que el bloque _header-logo de Horizon.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if section.settings.show_brand -%}
  <header class="udc udc-pp-brand" id="udc-pp-brand-{{ section.id }}">
    <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}" class="udc-pp-brand__link">
      {%- if settings.logo != blank -%}
        <img src="{{ settings.logo | image_url: height: 120 }}" alt="{{ settings.logo.alt | default: shop.name | escape }}"
             width="{{ settings.logo.width }}" height="{{ settings.logo.height }}" class="udc-pp-brand__img">
      {%- else -%}
        <span class="udc-pp-brand__name">{{ shop.name }}</span>
      {%- endif -%}
    </a>
  </header>
{%- endif -%}

<section class="udc udc-top udc-pp" id="udc-pp-{{ section.id }}">
  <div class="udc-pp__grid">
    <div class="udc-pp__media" data-udc-reveal>
      {%- if product.featured_image != blank -%}
        <img src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 900 }}"
             loading="lazy"
             width="{{ product.featured_image.width }}"
             height="{{ product.featured_image.height }}"
             alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | default: product.title | escape }}">
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    <div class="udc-pp__info" data-udc-reveal>
      {%- if section.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}
        <span class="udc-eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow }}</span>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if section.settings.rating_score != blank -%}
        <div class="udc-pp__rating">
          <span class="udc-pp__stars" aria-hidden="true"><span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span></span>
          <span>{{ section.settings.rating_label }} <strong>{{ section.settings.rating_score }}/5</strong> {{ section.settings.rating_source }}</span>
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      <h1 class="udc-h2 udc-pp__title">{{ product.title }}</h1>

      <div class="udc-pp__price">
        {%- if tier1.compare_at_price > tier1.price -%}
          <s class="udc-pp__compare">{{ tier1.compare_at_price | money }}</s>
        {%- endif -%}
        <span class="udc-pp__pricenow">{{ tier1.price | money }}</span>
        {%- if tier1.compare_at_price > tier1.price -%}
          {%- assign off_pct = tier1.price | times: 100 | divided_by: tier1.compare_at_price -%}
          {%- assign off_pct = 100 | minus: off_pct -%}
          <span class="udc-pp__offbadge">-{{ off_pct }}% OFF</span>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

      {%- if section.blocks.size > 0 -%}
        <div class="udc-pp__benefits">
          {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
            {%- if block.type == 'benefit' -%}
              <div class="udc-pp__benefit" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                <span class="udc-pp__benefiticon" aria-hidden="true">{{ block.settings.icon }}</span>
                <span>{{ block.settings.text }}</span>
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if section.settings.divider_text != blank -%}
        <div class="udc-pp__divider"><span>{{ section.settings.divider_text }}</span></div>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if section.settings.countdown_label != blank -%}
        <div class="udc-pp__countdown" data-udc-pp-countdown data-hours="{{ section.settings.countdown_hours | default: 24 }}">
          <span aria-hidden="true">🔥</span>
          {{ section.settings.countdown_label }}
          <span class="udc-pp__countdown-clock" data-udc-pp-clock>00:00:00</span>
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- assign pp_form_id = 'udc-pp-form-' | append: section.id -%}
      {%- form 'product', product, class: 'udc-pp__form', id: pp_form_id -%}
        <div class="udc-pp__tiers" data-udc-pp-tiers>
          {%- for variant in product.variants -%}
            {%- assign qty = forloop.index -%}
            {%- assign unit_price = variant.price | divided_by: qty -%}
            {%- assign unit_compare = variant.compare_at_price | divided_by: qty -%}
            {%- assign savings = variant.compare_at_price | minus: variant.price -%}

            <label class="udc-pp__tier{% if forloop.first %} is-selected{% endif %}">
              <input type="radio" name="udc-pp-tier-{{ section.id }}" value="{{ variant.id }}"
                     data-price="{{ variant.price | money | escape }}"
                     data-udc-pp-tier-radio {% if forloop.first %}checked{% endif %}>
              <span class="udc-pp__tier__radio" aria-hidden="true"></span>

              <span class="udc-pp__tier__main">
                <span class="udc-pp__tier__row">
                  <span class="udc-pp__tier__name">{{ section.settings.tier_label | default: 'Llevando' }} {{ qty }}</span>
                  {%- if forloop.first -%}
                    {%- if section.settings.tier1_badge != blank -%}
                      <span class="udc-pp__tier__badge">{{ section.settings.tier1_badge }}</span>
                    {%- endif -%}
                  {%- else -%}
                    {%- assign ratio = unit_price | times: 100 | divided_by: tier1.price -%}
                    {%- assign extra_pct = 100 | minus: ratio -%}
                    {%- if extra_pct > 0 -%}
                      <span class="udc-pp__tier__badge udc-pp__tier__badge--extra">+{{ extra_pct }}% OFF EXTRA</span>
                    {%- endif -%}
                  {%- endif -%}
                </span>
                {%- if savings > 0 -%}
                  <span class="udc-pp__tier__save">{{ section.settings.savings_label | default: 'Ahorrá' }} {{ savings | money }}</span>
                {%- endif -%}
              </span>

              <span class="udc-pp__tier__prices">
                <span class="udc-pp__tier__pricenow">{{ unit_price | money }}</span>
                {%- if unit_compare > unit_price -%}
                  <s class="udc-pp__tier__pricecompare">{{ unit_compare | money }}</s>
                {%- endif -%}
              </span>
            </label>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>

        <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ tier1.id }}" data-udc-pp-variant-input>

        {%- if section.settings.bump_product != blank and section.settings.bump_product.selected_or_first_available_variant.available -%}
          {%- assign bump_variant = section.settings.bump_product.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}
          <label class="udc-pp__bump">
            <input type="checkbox" data-udc-pp-bump-toggle>
            {%- if section.settings.bump_product.featured_image != blank -%}
              <span class="udc-pp__bump__thumb">
                <img src="{{ section.settings.bump_product.featured_image | image_url: width: 160 }}" loading="lazy" alt="{{ section.settings.bump_product.title | escape }}">
              </span>
            {%- endif -%}
            <span class="udc-pp__bump__title">{{ section.settings.bump_label | default: '+ Sumá' }} {{ section.settings.bump_product.title }}</span>
            <span class="udc-pp__bump__prices">
              <span class="udc-pp__bump__pricenow">{{ bump_variant.price | money }}</span>
              {%- if bump_variant.compare_at_price > bump_variant.price -%}
                <s class="udc-pp__bump__pricecompare">{{ bump_variant.compare_at_price | money }}</s>
              {%- endif -%}
            </span>
          </label>
          <input type="hidden" data-udc-pp-bump-variant-id value="{{ bump_variant.id }}">
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if section.settings.gift_text != blank -%}
          <p class="udc-serif udc-pp__gift">{{ section.settings.gift_text }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}

        <button type="submit"
                name="add"
                class="udc-btn udc-pp__add"
                {% unless current_variant.available %}disabled{% endunless %}>
          {%- if current_variant.available -%}
            {{ section.settings.add_text | default: 'Agregar al carrito →' }}
          {%- else -%}
            {{ section.settings.sold_out_text | default: 'Agotado' }}
          {%- endif -%}
        </button>

        {%- if section.settings.trust_bold != blank or section.settings.trust_rest != blank -%}
          <p class="udc-pp__trust"><strong>{{ section.settings.trust_bold }}</strong> {{ section.settings.trust_rest }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if section.settings.payment_row != blank -%}
          <div class="udc-pp__pay">
            {%- assign pays = section.settings.payment_row | split: ',' -%}
            {%- for p in pays -%}
              {%- assign p = p | strip -%}
              {%- if p != blank -%}<span>{{ p }}</span>{%- endif -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if section.settings.badge1_text != blank or section.settings.badge2_text != blank or section.settings.badge3_text != blank -%}
          <div class="udc-pp__badges">
            {%- if section.settings.badge1_text != blank -%}
              <span class="udc-pp__miniBadge"><span aria-hidden="true">{{ section.settings.badge1_icon }}</span>{{ section.settings.badge1_text }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if section.settings.badge2_text != blank -%}
              <span class="udc-pp__miniBadge"><span aria-hidden="true">{{ section.settings.badge2_icon }}</span>{{ section.settings.badge2_text }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if section.settings.badge3_text != blank -%}
              <span class="udc-pp__miniBadge"><span aria-hidden="true">{{ section.settings.badge3_icon }}</span>{{ section.settings.badge3_text }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endform -%}

      <div class="udc-pp__tabs" data-udc-pp-tabs>
        <div class="udc-pp__tabbar" role="tablist">
          <button type="button" class="udc-pp__tabbtn is-active" data-udc-pp-tabbtn="descripcion">{{ section.settings.tab_desc_label | default: 'Descripción' }}</button>
          <button type="button" class="udc-pp__tabbtn" data-udc-pp-tabbtn="entrega">{{ section.settings.tab_entrega_label | default: 'Entrega' }}</button>
          <button type="button" class="udc-pp__tabbtn" data-udc-pp-tabbtn="garantia">{{ section.settings.tab_garantia_label | default: 'Garantía' }}</button>
        </div>
        <div class="udc-pp__tabpanel is-active" data-udc-pp-tabpanel="descripcion">
          {%- if product.description != blank -%}
            {{ product.description }}
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
        <div class="udc-pp__tabpanel" data-udc-pp-tabpanel="entrega">
          {{ section.settings.tab_entrega_text }}
        </div>
        <div class="udc-pp__tabpanel" data-udc-pp-tabpanel="garantia">
          {{ section.settings.tab_garantia_text }}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- if section.settings.sticky_enabled and current_variant.available -%}
    <div class="udc-pp__sticky" id="udc-pp-sticky-{{ section.id }}" data-udc-pp-sticky>
      <div class="udc-pp__sticky-inner">
        {%- if product.featured_image != blank -%}
          <img class="udc-pp__sticky-img" src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 120 }}"
               width="48" height="48" loading="lazy" alt="">
        {%- endif -%}
        <div class="udc-pp__sticky-info">
          <span class="udc-pp__sticky-title">{{ product.title }}</span>
          <span class="udc-pp__sticky-price" data-udc-pp-sticky-price>{{ tier1.price | money }}</span>
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="udc-btn udc-pp__sticky-btn" data-udc-pp-sticky-btn tabindex="-1">
          {{ section.settings.sticky_text | default: 'Agregar al carrito' }}
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
</section>

<style>
  #udc-pp-brand-{{ section.id }}{
    display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;padding:18px 20px}
  #udc-pp-brand-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp-brand__link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;color:var(--udc-text);text-decoration:none}
  #udc-pp-brand-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp-brand__img{
    display:block;width:auto;height:{{ settings.logo_height_mobile | default: 28 }}px;object-fit:contain}
  @media (min-width:750px){
    #udc-pp-brand-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp-brand__img{height:{{ settings.logo_height | default: 36 }}px}
  }
  #udc-pp-brand-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp-brand__name{
    font-family:var(--udc-anton);font-size:20px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase}

  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }}{overflow:hidden}

  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__grid{
    position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:clamp(28px,5vw,56px);
    max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto}
  @media (min-width:860px){
    #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__grid{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,420px) 1fr;align-items:start}
  }

  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__media{
    position:relative;aspect-ratio:4/5;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;
    border:1px solid var(--udc-border);background:var(--udc-bg2);
    box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.7)}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__media img{
    display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}

  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__title{margin:14px 0 0}

  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__rating{
    display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 10px;margin:16px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--udc-muted)}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__rating strong{color:var(--udc-text)}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__stars{display:inline-flex;gap:3px}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__stars span{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:3px;
    background:var(--udc-accent);color:#fff;font-size:11px;line-height:1}

  #udc-pp-sticky-{{ section.id }}{
    position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:60;
    padding:10px clamp(12px,4vw,24px) calc(10px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
    background:rgba(8,8,8,.92);border-top:1px solid var(--udc-line);
    backdrop-filter:blur(12px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);
    box-shadow:0 -20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.55);
    transform:translateY(115%);transition:transform .45s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1);
    font-family:var(--udc-sans);color:var(--udc-text)}
  #udc-pp-sticky-{{ section.id }}.is-visible{transform:none}
  #udc-pp-sticky-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__sticky-inner{
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto}
  #udc-pp-sticky-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__sticky-img{
    flex:0 0 auto;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:10px;object-fit:cover;border:1px solid var(--udc-border)}
  #udc-pp-sticky-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__sticky-info{flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px}
  #udc-pp-sticky-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__sticky-title{
    font-size:13px;line-height:1.3;color:var(--udc-text);
    display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden}
  #udc-pp-sticky-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__sticky-price{font-family:var(--udc-anton);font-size:16px;color:var(--udc-text)}
  #udc-pp-sticky-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__sticky-btn{
    flex:0 0 auto;font-size:14px;padding:13px 20px;
    box-shadow:0 0 36px color-mix(in srgb, var(--udc-accent) 45%, transparent)}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    #udc-pp-sticky-{{ section.id }}{transition:none}
  }

  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__price{
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:22px 0 0}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__compare{font-size:16px;color:var(--udc-dim)}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__pricenow{
    font-family:var(--udc-anton);font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(26px,3vw,36px);color:var(--udc-text)}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__offbadge{
    background:var(--udc-accent);color:#fff;font-family:var(--udc-anton);font-size:12px;
    letter-spacing:.06em;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:999px}

  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__benefits{
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px 16px;margin:28px 0 0}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__benefit{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-size:14px;color:var(--udc-text);font-weight:700}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__benefiticon{font-size:22px;line-height:1;flex:0 0 auto}

  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__divider{
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;margin:36px 0 0;
    font-family:var(--udc-anton);font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--udc-text)}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__divider::before,
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__divider::after{content:'';flex:1 1 auto;height:1px;background:var(--udc-line)}

  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__countdown{
    margin:22px 0 0;padding:16px 20px;border-radius:14px;text-align:center;font-size:14px;
    font-weight:700;color:#fff;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--udc-accent),#7A0D0D)}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__countdown-clock{
    display:inline-block;margin-left:6px;font-family:var(--udc-anton);letter-spacing:.04em}

  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__tiers{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;margin:24px 0 0}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__tier{
    position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;cursor:pointer;
    border:1px solid var(--udc-border);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 18px;
    transition:border-color .2s ease,box-shadow .2s ease}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__tier input{position:absolute;opacity:0;pointer-events:none}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__tier.is-selected{
    border-color:var(--udc-accent);box-shadow:0 0 30px color-mix(in srgb, var(--udc-accent) 25%, transparent)}

  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__tier__radio{
    flex:0 0 auto;width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid #3A3A34;position:relative}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__tier.is-selected .udc-pp__tier__radio{border-color:var(--udc-accent)}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__tier.is-selected .udc-pp__tier__radio::after{
    content:'';position:absolute;inset:3px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--udc-accent)}

  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__tier__main{flex:1 1 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;min-width:0}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__tier__row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__tier__name{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--udc-text)}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__tier__badge{
    font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:var(--udc-accent);
    border:1px solid var(--udc-accent);border-radius:999px;padding:3px 10px}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__tier__badge--extra{background:var(--udc-accent);color:#fff}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__tier__save{font-size:12px;color:var(--udc-dim)}

  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__tier__prices{flex:0 0 auto;text-align:right;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__tier__pricenow{
    font-family:var(--udc-anton);font-size:19px;color:var(--udc-text)}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__tier__pricecompare{font-size:12px;color:var(--udc-dim)}

  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__bump{
    margin:20px 0 0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;cursor:pointer;
    border:1px dashed #443B3B;border-radius:14px;padding:14px 16px}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__bump input{flex:0 0 auto;width:18px;height:18px;accent-color:var(--udc-accent)}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__bump__thumb{
    flex:0 0 auto;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--udc-bg2)}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__bump__thumb img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__bump__title{flex:1 1 auto;font-size:13px;color:var(--udc-text);min-width:0}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__bump__prices{flex:0 0 auto;text-align:right;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__bump__pricenow{font-family:var(--udc-anton);font-size:15px;color:var(--udc-text)}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__bump__pricecompare{font-size:11px;color:var(--udc-dim)}

  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__gift{
    margin:16px 0 0;text-align:center;font-size:14px;color:var(--udc-muted)}

  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__form{margin-top:6px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__add{margin-top:20px;width:100%}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__add:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed;box-shadow:none}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__add:disabled:hover{transform:none}

  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__trust{
    margin:16px 0 0;text-align:center;font-size:13px;color:var(--udc-dim)}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__trust strong{color:var(--udc-text)}

  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__pay{
    display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:10px;margin-top:14px}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__pay span{
    font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--udc-muted);
    border:1px solid var(--udc-border);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 14px}

  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__badges{
    display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:12px;margin-top:16px}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__miniBadge{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:13px;color:var(--udc-text);
    border:1px solid var(--udc-border);border-radius:999px;padding:10px 18px}

  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__tabs{margin:36px 0 0}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__tabbar{
    display:flex;gap:clamp(20px,4vw,36px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--udc-line)}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__tabbtn{
    background:none;border:0;padding:0 0 14px;font-family:var(--udc-anton);font-size:13px;
    letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--udc-dim);cursor:pointer;
    position:relative;transition:color .2s ease}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__tabbtn.is-active{color:var(--udc-text)}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__tabbtn.is-active::after{
    content:'';position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:-1px;height:2px;background:var(--udc-accent)}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__tabpanel{
    display:none;margin-top:22px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#D9D9CF}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__tabpanel.is-active{display:block}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__tabpanel p{margin:0 0 12px}
  #udc-pp-{{ section.id }} .udc-pp__tabpanel p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
</style>

